{
    "test_name": "MOB.622_Collector_Photo_Carousel",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.622_Collector_Photo_Carousel",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.622` **The carousel's DISPLAY surface \u2014 read at ONE photo and at TWO.**\n- \u26d4 **This retires a fixture ask rather than waiting on it.** The surface sat in \ud83d\udfe1 BLOCKED\n  behind *\"\u22652 photos on a named fixture asset\"*, which assumed photos can only arrive\n  **before page load**. `ADD_PHOTO` **appends** (`Form/utils.ts:124`), so uploading twice\n  supplies them at runtime \u2014 and it dispatches to a **local reducer**, so a test that never\n  submits writes nothing.\n- \u2b50 **The central assertion is a BICONDITIONAL across the two states.**\n  `withIndicators`/`withControls` are `{photos.length > 1}`. Asserting they *appear* would\n  pass on a carousel that always shows them, so the same two facts are read at one photo and\n  at two and **required to disagree** \u2014 the conditional pinned in both directions, one run.\n- \u2b50 Same shape again for **`aria-label=\"Close\"`**, which renders *only* in fullscreen\n  (`PhotoMenu:130`) \u2014 absent before, present inside. And the **fullscreen carousel is\n  `withIndicators` UNCONDITIONALLY** (`index.tsx:177`): two carousels, two different rules.\n- Covers what nothing had reached: `PhotoMenu` (proven to render for a **local, unsaved**\n  photo \u2014 the fact the withdrawn ask turned on), **View in Fullscreen**, the derived\n  **`Edit Tags (0)`** badge, and \u2b50 the **FULL `TagSelector`** (`Search tags...`) \u2014 a\n  different component from the `MiniTagSelector` (`Auto-apply tags?`) `MOB.620` pins.\n- \ud83d\uded1 **READ-ONLY, and the tag controls are asserted but NEVER actuated** \u2014 assigning or\n  creating a tag writes (`Tags/index.tsx:100`). The editor is dismissed with its own `Done`,\n  and the form is closed without submitting, so no asset and no attachment are created.\n- \u26a0\ufe0f **Trap 3 at its worst: four modals can be mounted at once**, three containing a\n  carousel and two containing an `aria-label=\"Close\"`. Nothing is selected by position \u2014\n  the inline carousel is scoped to `#asset-collector`, and fullscreen is identified as *the\n  modal with a carousel that does not contain the form*.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Asset Collector",
            "Photos",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
